  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\">[그냥&nbsp;정보]&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\">내일이&nbsp;개학인데,&nbsp;평가계획&nbsp;쓰기&nbsp;싫어서&nbsp;딴&nbsp;짓&nbsp;중입니다^^&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\">과학동아,&nbsp;어린이&nbsp;과학동아,&nbsp;수학동아&nbsp;내용을&nbsp;수업에&nbsp;활용하고&nbsp;싶을&nbsp;때,&nbsp;잡지를&nbsp;복사해서&nbsp;사용하기는&nbsp;좀&nbsp;그렇고..&nbsp;인터넷으로&nbsp;기사를&nbsp;다운받거나&nbsp;인쇄하고&nbsp;싶지만,&nbsp;잡지&nbsp;기사는&nbsp;맛보기만&nbsp;나옵니다.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\">과학동아에서&nbsp;'디라이브러리'라는&nbsp;사이트를&nbsp;만들어놨더군요.&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://dl.dongascience.com/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\"><font color=\"blue\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border: 0px; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\">http://dl.dongascience.com/</font></a><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\">교사회원&nbsp;인증하면&nbsp;1년짜리&nbsp;이용권&nbsp;5만원으로&nbsp;결제가능합니다.(9월1일부터&nbsp;8만원으로&nbsp;오른대요.)&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\">잡지&nbsp;세&nbsp;권을&nbsp;10년&nbsp;훨씬&nbsp;더&nbsp;전&nbsp;것까지&nbsp;검색할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있으니&nbsp;괜찮은&nbsp;것&nbsp;같습니다.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\">-&nbsp;저는&nbsp;학교돈으로&nbsp;샀습니다~&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 55, 50); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px;\">-&nbsp;제가&nbsp;이런&nbsp;이용권을&nbsp;지르게&nbsp;된&nbsp;건,&nbsp;과학동아&nbsp;기사&nbsp;중&nbsp;'광물이야기'때문이었는데요.&nbsp;학교에&nbsp;과학동아&nbsp;받아보시면,&nbsp;7,8월분&nbsp;한&nbsp;번&nbsp;보세요.&nbsp;&nbsp;철에&nbsp;대한&nbsp;얘기가&nbsp;나오는데&nbsp;재밌습니다^^</span><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
